WEBVTT

00:18.080 --> 00:22.290
THE FOOLISH ANGEL DANCES WITH THE DEVIL

01:33.890 --> 01:35.250
So sleepy.

01:35.250 --> 01:38.040
I'll fall asleep if I don't try hard.

01:38.830 --> 01:40.250
It's embarrassing to say.

01:40.250 --> 01:41.410
It's because I...

01:42.290 --> 01:44.920
haven't been able to sleep
at all since last night.

01:44.920 --> 01:48.920
It's all because of
what happened yesterday.

01:53.590 --> 01:55.350
I need to pull myself together.

01:55.800 --> 01:57.390
I am an angel.

01:58.810 --> 02:00.520
I have to defeat the demon,

02:01.480 --> 02:02.640
making the world...

02:03.390 --> 02:04.920
become...

02:11.860 --> 02:13.000
This place...

02:14.170 --> 02:15.490
Where is this?

02:15.490 --> 02:17.870
I'm supposed to be in class.

02:18.100 --> 02:18.790
No way!

02:22.620 --> 02:23.600
So sleepy.

02:24.790 --> 02:27.170
It's all because
I didn't sleep well last night.

02:29.300 --> 02:31.430
I can't believe I doze off.

02:31.430 --> 02:33.710
As a top student,
how could I make such a mistake?

02:33.710 --> 02:34.630
What's wrong?

02:35.680 --> 02:36.800
Little girl.

02:38.220 --> 02:39.470
Do you need my help?

02:42.230 --> 02:44.270
W-What happened?

02:44.890 --> 02:47.810
I can't believe Akutsu is in my dream.

02:49.020 --> 02:50.190
Moreover,

02:50.730 --> 02:53.140
LITTLE GIRL. DO YOU NEED MY HELP?
Why is it in the style of a love game?

02:54.360 --> 02:55.660
None of it matters.

02:55.660 --> 02:57.570
I have to wake up now.

02:58.340 --> 02:59.370
Right.

02:59.910 --> 03:01.620
Since it's a love game,

03:01.620 --> 03:04.840
maybe I can find a way to get Akutsu.

03:05.870 --> 03:08.290
I can get him like this...

03:08.840 --> 03:11.920
- Why do you keep staring at me?
- Akutsu!

03:13.800 --> 03:15.530
Is it a bug?

03:16.090 --> 03:16.800
So disgusting.

03:18.220 --> 03:19.760
Options?

03:20.300 --> 03:21.760
What?

03:23.350 --> 03:24.350
I don't understand.

03:25.020 --> 03:27.560
But I have to continue anyway.

03:27.560 --> 03:29.190
Anyway, just choose one.

03:31.770 --> 03:32.360
Okay.

03:32.820 --> 03:35.240
- Let me show you my power.
- Disgusting!

03:35.780 --> 03:37.830
This game has too many bugs!

03:37.830 --> 03:40.770
Come on, come closer to me.

03:40.770 --> 03:42.370
Annoying.

03:46.210 --> 03:47.410
By the way,

03:48.500 --> 03:51.040
it's rare to see Amane dozing off.

03:51.710 --> 03:53.810
I wonder what she looks like.

03:58.630 --> 03:59.220
Okay.

03:59.930 --> 04:01.710
Just pretend I didn't see it.

04:10.440 --> 04:12.650
After my repeated attempts,

04:12.650 --> 04:14.650
CLOTHES ARE GONE
I'm finally here.

04:15.230 --> 04:17.700
Next, just complete this dating task,

04:17.700 --> 04:20.029
then I can get Akutsu.

04:20.029 --> 04:22.029
I should wake up by then.

04:23.580 --> 04:24.450
Date?

04:28.500 --> 04:30.290
What am I thinking about?

04:30.290 --> 04:32.880
It's just a task in the game.

04:32.880 --> 04:35.430
I have no other choice.

04:37.050 --> 04:37.780
Akutsu?

04:38.170 --> 04:39.050
Sorry to keep you waiting.

04:39.050 --> 04:41.680
- Sorry I just suddenly flew up.
- What? -

04:44.600 --> 04:46.390
Maybe I should wake her up.

04:48.100 --> 04:51.440
You scared me!

04:51.440 --> 04:54.380
Forget it.
She looks quite happy.

04:57.110 --> 04:59.990
I shouldn't be
thinking about dating thing.

04:59.990 --> 05:01.990
I-I can't look him in the face.

05:02.660 --> 05:05.490
What? He's a demon.

05:05.490 --> 05:07.500
Why do I get butterflies for him?

05:07.500 --> 05:08.350
Why?

05:13.420 --> 05:15.170
This is...

05:16.250 --> 05:18.050
I've felt that way for a long time.

05:18.920 --> 05:20.680
Maybe I've...

05:21.510 --> 05:22.970
already fallen for you.

05:23.260 --> 05:25.760
Ah!

05:26.310 --> 05:27.390
Close your eyes.

05:27.390 --> 05:29.810
What are you talking about?

05:29.810 --> 05:31.440
You demon.

05:33.020 --> 05:35.610
CLOSE EYES / DON'T CLOSE EYES

05:35.610 --> 05:37.690
Of course no.

05:40.900 --> 05:42.350
What am I hesitating about?

05:42.860 --> 05:44.070
Don't tell me I...

05:44.470 --> 05:46.530
actually care about...

05:47.540 --> 05:51.580
this option, and...

05:52.460 --> 05:54.000
what happens after it.

06:02.260 --> 06:04.770
My name is Waist Samurai.

06:09.020 --> 06:11.430
Akutsu!

06:14.190 --> 06:16.480
You, get up!

06:16.900 --> 06:17.900
I'm sorry.

06:18.360 --> 06:19.730
I was careless.

06:20.570 --> 06:22.830
I accidentally ate too much
and let that guy...

06:24.610 --> 06:27.240
Hey, don't be so sad.

06:27.990 --> 06:30.490
I'm already content.

06:31.200 --> 06:33.460
This is the first time
I've fallen for someone.

06:34.330 --> 06:35.580
So, in the end,

06:36.630 --> 06:38.500
for the last time,

06:39.500 --> 06:40.960
let me see your smile once more.

06:48.890 --> 06:52.480
Akutsu!

06:54.060 --> 06:55.060
Amane.

06:57.060 --> 06:58.930
You look really upset.

06:58.930 --> 07:01.280
Are you okay?
Maybe you should go to the infirmary.

07:01.780 --> 07:03.830
Akutsu.

07:05.150 --> 07:07.160
So it's a dream.

07:07.490 --> 07:10.080
Akutsu, you made her cry.

07:10.080 --> 07:11.120
Me?

07:15.160 --> 07:17.670
INFIRMARY

07:30.890 --> 07:32.390
Recently,

07:32.390 --> 07:34.430
my heart is always wavering.

07:35.740 --> 07:40.120
I thought I could handle it with ease.

07:40.940 --> 07:42.360
No wonder,

07:47.490 --> 07:50.240
the scenery here is too dazzling.

07:51.530 --> 07:53.330
Excuse me.

07:55.080 --> 07:56.250
Amane, are you there?

07:56.710 --> 07:58.420
Tanahashi is worried about you.

07:59.130 --> 08:00.110
I'm coming in.

08:04.340 --> 08:05.760
Still asleep?

08:06.380 --> 08:08.260
Why is Akutsu here?

08:08.260 --> 08:10.090
What does he want to do?

08:10.510 --> 08:12.680
What does he want?

08:14.350 --> 08:15.350
Are you okay?

08:15.760 --> 08:18.390
You've come to the infirmary
after you cried from a nightmare,

08:18.390 --> 08:19.770
I am really worried about you.

08:20.450 --> 08:22.020
Beyond all question,

08:22.020 --> 08:23.610
he must want to use the visit

08:23.610 --> 08:27.110
to tantalize me
with something sweet and sour.

08:27.570 --> 08:28.700
Humph.

08:28.700 --> 08:30.260
You're too naive.

08:30.660 --> 08:33.380
I'll take my revenge first and then...

08:35.539 --> 08:37.500
And then...

08:38.500 --> 08:40.789
No, what am I thinking about?

08:40.789 --> 08:42.150
Just a demon.

08:44.590 --> 08:46.380
What are you up to?

08:46.380 --> 08:48.470
What? Are you awake?

08:48.470 --> 08:50.220
You should have said so earlier.

08:50.720 --> 08:51.590
Actually...

08:56.600 --> 08:58.350
This guy is up to something.

08:58.810 --> 09:01.350
He wants to sneak up
on me while I sleep.

09:02.560 --> 09:04.320
He truly underestimates me.

09:04.320 --> 09:06.820
I'm not a pushover.

09:07.110 --> 09:08.500
Whoa!

09:09.110 --> 09:10.610
What are you doing?

09:11.070 --> 09:12.700
What a pity.

09:12.700 --> 09:14.740
I won't let you succeed.

09:14.740 --> 09:15.990
HAHAHA
But...

09:15.990 --> 09:19.710
I appreciate your courage in trying
to sneak up on me while I sleep.

09:19.710 --> 09:22.120
For the sake of that, I will...

09:24.420 --> 09:25.540
Disgusting.

09:25.540 --> 09:27.420
You did it, didn't you?

09:27.420 --> 09:28.710
What do you want to do?

09:30.550 --> 09:32.260
Are you still going to play dumb?

09:32.260 --> 09:34.390
I have seen through your plot.

09:35.180 --> 09:37.430
You want to make some fun

09:37.430 --> 09:42.650
by making me display various poses
while I'm sleep, right?

09:43.020 --> 09:45.520
No, I have no such thoughts at all.

09:46.190 --> 09:48.320
Seeing you asleep,
I thought to wait outside.

09:48.730 --> 09:52.200
Then why did you take off your tie
and undone the buttons?

09:52.740 --> 09:54.410
I want to ask you something.

09:55.240 --> 09:56.120
This...

10:01.330 --> 10:04.210
So, can you get rid of this?

10:04.210 --> 10:05.710
Impossible.

10:05.710 --> 10:07.000
Amane.

10:07.000 --> 10:08.460
You're really annoying.

10:08.460 --> 10:11.300
Why would I remove
your collar for no reason?

10:11.300 --> 10:12.710
It's for a reason.

10:13.070 --> 10:14.180
What?

10:15.300 --> 10:16.260
I...

10:16.890 --> 10:17.890
I...

10:20.100 --> 10:22.230
I want to go to the bathhouse!

10:22.730 --> 10:23.810
What?

10:23.810 --> 10:26.230
So at least change it
into an inconspicuous color.

10:26.650 --> 10:29.320
Otherwise, I wouldn't even be
able to undo the first button,

10:29.730 --> 10:31.610
and I can't go to the pool either.

10:31.610 --> 10:33.280
Akutsu.

10:33.280 --> 10:36.990
You want to change the color because
you want to go to the pool and bathhouse?

10:36.990 --> 10:40.720
You! Are you really here
looking for talent?

10:41.790 --> 10:42.740
I...

10:43.910 --> 10:46.210
I didn't have a good time
in the Demon Realm.

10:49.210 --> 10:52.090
But since I came into this world,
I've met all kinds of people.

10:52.090 --> 10:53.670
My life is now fulfilling.

10:54.800 --> 10:57.260
So when I work, I work hard.

10:57.260 --> 11:00.140
And enjoy myself
to the fullest in my free time.

11:01.350 --> 11:04.530
Unlike the Demon Realm,
I'm dazzled by everything here.

11:05.850 --> 11:06.770
However,

11:07.190 --> 11:11.030
I don't think an angel who never worries
about anything would understand.

11:12.990 --> 11:15.200
Why doesn't she say anything?

11:16.320 --> 11:18.820
Anyway, what have I been saying?

11:19.110 --> 11:21.450
AHHHHH
I accidentally started talking about myself.

11:21.450 --> 11:22.870
Disgusting, really disgusting!

11:22.870 --> 11:25.580
DISGUSTING
She must be mocking me like this in her mind.

11:26.890 --> 11:28.380
WOO
It's not that I can't understand.

11:28.380 --> 11:30.590
Yes, how could the angel...

11:32.800 --> 11:33.920
It's not that...

11:35.510 --> 11:36.430
...I can't understand.

11:38.300 --> 11:39.300
Amane.

11:43.640 --> 11:46.530
Well, I have no other choice.

11:47.270 --> 11:49.060
Although it's troublesome, I'll help you.

11:49.810 --> 11:54.940
I'll get rid of it, so you can go
to the pool and the bathhouse.

11:58.200 --> 12:00.490
So, what should I do?

12:01.080 --> 12:03.200
I just need to change the structure.

12:03.200 --> 12:05.030
You just sit.

12:05.830 --> 12:06.370
Then...

12:21.800 --> 12:22.810
This is...

12:23.310 --> 12:25.140
What happened?
Did you make a mistake?

12:25.140 --> 12:26.350
Am I going to die?

12:44.910 --> 12:47.000
Wait, I didn't want to do this.

12:47.450 --> 12:48.620
Run!

12:48.910 --> 12:50.080
What? Run?

12:50.080 --> 12:51.080
Akutsu!

12:59.430 --> 13:00.300
Akutsu!

13:00.880 --> 13:01.890
That was close!

13:02.180 --> 13:04.100
Who is this guy anyway?

13:04.600 --> 13:07.180
Sorry, this is a weapon
to against demons.

13:07.180 --> 13:08.520
It's my host body.

13:08.890 --> 13:09.980
Host body?

13:11.020 --> 13:13.400
I put it in your neck,

13:13.400 --> 13:14.810
but it came out somehow.

13:14.810 --> 13:17.220
I can't believe you put something
like this in my neck.

13:17.220 --> 13:19.610
Well, this is to prevent you
from betraying me.

13:20.150 --> 13:21.530
Amane!

13:24.450 --> 13:25.490
Why?

13:25.490 --> 13:27.700
Why would it attack me as its master?

13:28.500 --> 13:31.290
It's supposed to respond to demons.

13:31.710 --> 13:33.250
What's going on here?

13:33.250 --> 13:35.070
Isn't that guy on your side?

13:35.960 --> 13:41.380
Well, maybe it malfunctions after spending
too much time inside a demon,

13:41.380 --> 13:43.550
so it attacks everyone.

13:43.970 --> 13:45.180
Hey!

13:45.180 --> 13:47.600
School time is long past.

13:47.600 --> 13:49.930
Let me see who is causing trouble here.

13:49.930 --> 13:50.890
Who are you?

13:52.640 --> 13:54.100
Protect him.

13:54.100 --> 13:55.770
It's out of control now.

13:56.190 --> 13:58.650
No matter who it is,
it will launch an attack.

14:19.090 --> 14:20.420
I'm saved.

14:20.420 --> 14:23.260
Just take him somewhere else.

14:24.760 --> 14:26.850
That guy still has the upper hand.

14:26.850 --> 14:29.720
This level of restraint
will soon be broken.

14:30.010 --> 14:32.230
Run while I can still restrain it.

14:32.770 --> 14:33.850
Akutsu?

14:33.850 --> 14:35.690
Why you...

14:35.690 --> 14:38.440
I-I heard your voice.

14:38.440 --> 14:39.650
I see.

14:39.650 --> 14:40.860
I can't make it anymore.

14:41.320 --> 14:43.900
Teacher, you're not injured at all.

14:43.900 --> 14:45.360
What?

14:45.360 --> 14:48.030
I was attacked by that mystery woman
and sent flying.

14:49.330 --> 14:50.540
You

14:50.540 --> 14:53.710
go evacuate the people
who are still in the school.

14:54.250 --> 14:55.870
Please.

14:55.870 --> 14:56.820
Teacher.

14:58.130 --> 14:59.920
Teacher!

15:02.670 --> 15:04.220
Teacher!

15:04.220 --> 15:07.180
You're taking too long.
I'll move him.

15:07.550 --> 15:09.050
It's okay now.

15:09.050 --> 15:11.930
NOT OKAY AT ALL

15:12.600 --> 15:13.670
Run to the schoolyard!

15:13.670 --> 15:14.650
Are you kidding me?

15:14.650 --> 15:15.940
It's too narrow here.

15:15.940 --> 15:17.310
I can no longer restrain it.

15:18.190 --> 15:21.730
I will deploy a barrier and find a way
to deal with it in there.

15:21.730 --> 15:23.570
I can't let anyone else get involved.

15:31.950 --> 15:33.580
It really followed.

15:47.550 --> 15:48.680
Impressive.

15:48.680 --> 15:50.990
The stage is set.

15:52.720 --> 15:54.350
Time to teach it a lesson!

15:54.350 --> 15:54.910
Okay!

16:05.650 --> 16:07.860
Now! Get control of it!

16:07.860 --> 16:09.360
Got it. Leave it to me.

16:13.330 --> 16:14.580
Why?

16:14.580 --> 16:17.080
My host body is not supposed
to be this strong.

16:25.630 --> 16:27.630
It's like someone is...

16:31.350 --> 16:32.160
That is...

16:34.010 --> 16:34.730
Amane!

16:35.140 --> 16:36.600
Are you okay?

16:37.020 --> 16:38.770
What is going on?

16:42.060 --> 16:44.020
Enough.

16:54.830 --> 16:56.160
No way.

16:59.210 --> 17:00.710
Amane, run!

17:08.420 --> 17:10.470
I told you to run.

17:10.470 --> 17:12.430
You damn foolish angel!

17:23.359 --> 17:25.940
It really hurts, you!

17:27.490 --> 17:28.610
Are you okay?

17:28.610 --> 17:29.700
No.

17:30.110 --> 17:31.530
Pull yourself together!

17:32.070 --> 17:34.700
How can you be taken down like that?

17:37.330 --> 17:39.160
I came here for the Demon Realm!

17:39.160 --> 17:41.000
Your situation is similar to mine, right?

17:41.000 --> 17:45.170
Yes, I came here to fulfill my ambition.

17:45.170 --> 17:48.260
So I won't back down
no matter what happens.

17:49.090 --> 17:51.430
But why am I like this now?

17:52.430 --> 17:56.650
I am swayed like this just by seeing
that guy's mark. What a shame!

17:57.600 --> 18:00.810
I can't believe I need a demon
to remind me that.

18:01.770 --> 18:02.940
I am Amane.

18:02.940 --> 18:06.400
How can I stop here?

18:10.070 --> 18:11.240
So, what should we do?

18:11.820 --> 18:13.860
I have an idea.

18:13.860 --> 18:16.490
It seems to be under someone's control.

18:16.490 --> 18:17.660
Control?

18:17.660 --> 18:19.130
Yes, so...

18:21.660 --> 18:23.870
Really? Does it work?

18:23.870 --> 18:25.460
What are you talking about?

18:25.460 --> 18:26.880
Trust your master.

18:29.340 --> 18:30.050
Alright then.

18:30.760 --> 18:31.730
Go!

18:31.730 --> 18:32.350
Okay!

18:34.970 --> 18:36.050
Don't rush.

18:44.560 --> 18:46.610
No matter how fast you are,

18:46.970 --> 18:49.980
you can do nothing without knowing
where the enemy will attack from.

18:49.980 --> 18:52.150
Okay, I found the weakness.

18:52.150 --> 18:53.150
Got it!

18:56.910 --> 18:58.240
No way.

18:58.780 --> 19:00.160
I didn't expect...

19:02.200 --> 19:04.660
...you really took the bait.

19:04.660 --> 19:06.330
Too naive.

19:10.670 --> 19:12.680
Everything will be fine
once we get you.

19:13.650 --> 19:14.170
Amane!

19:14.630 --> 19:18.100
Oh my. If you could control it,
I could take it down easier.

19:18.100 --> 19:19.350
You useless demon!

19:25.230 --> 19:26.690
It's the snake.

19:26.690 --> 19:29.650
Give me back my host body.

19:47.460 --> 19:48.580
Is it over?

19:48.580 --> 19:49.410
Yes.

19:51.550 --> 19:54.010
I'm more tired than usual.

19:55.130 --> 19:56.720
My body feels so heavy.

19:57.090 --> 19:59.970
Sorry, your power
is still sealed by me.

19:59.970 --> 20:01.300
No way!

20:01.300 --> 20:03.270
Is that why I can't exert my strength?

20:03.850 --> 20:06.020
Thank you for your help.

20:06.020 --> 20:07.310
Don't mention it.

20:07.810 --> 20:11.370
Right. Please tell me you didn't put
that guy back in me.

20:11.940 --> 20:13.530
I've eradicated the snake.

20:13.530 --> 20:15.110
What about the host body?

20:15.110 --> 20:18.710
Of course, it's back in my body.

20:20.030 --> 20:20.790
Amane!

20:23.910 --> 20:24.780
Amane!

20:25.370 --> 20:26.090
Hey!

20:33.380 --> 20:34.580
The barrier is collapsing?

20:35.300 --> 20:36.650
We need to get out of here.

20:43.560 --> 20:45.520
What a useless fellow.

20:46.810 --> 20:49.770
But she could beat my snake.

20:49.770 --> 20:52.080
When did she get so amazing?

20:52.900 --> 20:54.150
I'm really curious.

20:54.900 --> 20:57.240
You go see what's going on.

20:57.850 --> 20:59.950
I don't think the permission
has come down yet.

20:59.950 --> 21:01.030
It's fine.

21:01.450 --> 21:03.280
I'll apply for it.

21:03.990 --> 21:05.450
I see.

21:05.450 --> 21:06.680
Sister.

21:28.310 --> 21:30.350
What am I thinking about?

21:33.610 --> 21:35.650
I'm really exhausted today.

21:36.320 --> 21:38.670
I can't believe I got into
such a troublesome matter.

21:39.110 --> 21:41.670
She hasn't made it for me yet!

21:43.370 --> 21:44.180
Sorry.

21:44.620 --> 21:46.660
Forget it.
Just leave it till tomorrow.

21:46.660 --> 21:47.660
I'm leaving.

21:55.090 --> 21:56.010
Amane?

22:00.170 --> 22:03.470
Don't go anywhere.
